      "content": "medication doesn't seem like it'll change the fact that i'm just... empty. it's like there's a wall between me and the rest of the world. no matter what i do, i'm still just standing there watching everything go by. i feel like i'm just taking up space. i'm just so tired of the struggle to feel anything at all. i just want it to be quiet. i want the void to finally be still.",
